    "detailed_description": "VRLab Academy: Anatomy VR is an interactive anatomy atlas.<br />\r\nWalk through the futuristic VRLab. Navigate smoothly and effortlessly, in this beautiful. and modern yet highly optimized Vr experience<br />\r\nSee the body disappears before your very eyes only to show the inner workings of the human anatomy.<br />\r\nYou can take any of the human organs, and inspect it with your virtual hands and eyes. Feel the beating heart or the breathing lungs. See the food traveling through the human body.<br />\r\nSee the: <br />\r\nBody systems Include<br />\r\n- Muscular System<br />\r\n- Skeletal System<br />\r\n- Urinary System<br />\r\n- Digestive System<br />\r\n- Lymphatic system<br />\r\n- Cardiovascular System<br />\r\n- System ventilators<br />\r\n- Nervous System<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease note that this is the Demo version with respect to VRLab Academy experiments.",
